L000492	be seen in \eqref{eq:binomargt}. From that, we deduce :
L000493	\[ H(K, N) \leq \sum_{k=0}^{K-1} |c_{k,N}|^2 \binom{N}{0} \frac{0!}{N^0} = \sum_{k=0}^{K-1} |c_{k,N}|^2.\]
L000494	We also get, using again the fact that the sequence is decreasing :
L000495	\[ T(K, N) \leq \sum_{k=K}^N |c_{k,N}|^2 \binom{N}{K} \frac{K!}{N^{K}}. \]
