L000537	    &\leq \sum_{k=K}^N |c_k|^2 \sum_{k=K}^N \binom{N}{k} \frac{|z|^{2k}}{N^{k}}\\
L000538	    &\leq \varepsilon \sum_{k=K}^N \binom{N}{k} \frac{R'^{2k}}{N^{k}}.
L000539	\end{align*}
L000540	If we then make the assumptions that $R'^2 \leq K$ and that $R'^{2K} \leq K!$ (when $K\gg1$ these two conditions are nearly equivalent). Hence for all $k \geq K$, we have
L000541	$R'^{2k} \leq k!$ and we can upper bound the difference between the polynomials by the following sum that we have already studied :
L000542	\begin{align*}
